Ipan yei tochtli xihuitl ( 1846 ) ompehua yaoyotl in tlein Tlatlahtocayotl in Cepanca chanehque oquichihuilique mexico inic quincuicuilizque anahuacah huel cenca huei icecniquizaliz intlaltzin . Inic yaoyopan quicuicuilique Mexico in axcan tiquixmatih yuhquin California , Nevada , Utah , Colorado , New Mexico , Texas , Arizona ihuan oc ce tlacotoncayotl . Quipalehuique in Iquizcan , omicque inin yaoyopan in itauhcayoque telpopochtin in iximachoh yuhquin Tiyacauhque Iconehuantzitzin Chapoltepec . Otlan in yaoyotl ipan macuilli tecpatl xihuitl ( 1848 ) .
