Ihcuac tlacati in conetl , ipan chicuey ilhuitl ye motema in nantli . Yahuih quitlanehuizqueh in temazcalli ( ahmo nochtlacah quipiah ) . In ihcuac ayahmo motlecuiltia , ihtic motlalia in popochtli ihuan cecerahtoton , tlahtlanihua quen itoca in temazcalli ihuan quinotzah , quilhuiah : “ Xiquihta , José ( intla inin itoca ) , nican nimitztlalilia in popochtli ihuan cera , nimitztlatlauhtia , nican tictemazqueh inin cone - atzintli , xic - huapahua cualli , ma totahtzin quimixotili , ma mochipa quimopalehuili , ayc ma quemman ipan huetziz in cocoliztli , ma nemi miec xihuitl , ma pacta muchipa . Timochin - tin tipahpaquizqueh intla cualli quizaz in inemiliz . ” Immanon mocuacualatza in atl ica teyahuitl ihuan motema in nantli ica icoconeton .
